{"id":"8f4cc1bda0927421","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-extendible-cardinal.md","title":"Extendible Cardinal","display":"df-extendible-cardinal — Extendible Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-extendible-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-extendible-cardinal"],"display":"df-extendible-cardinal — Extendible Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-extendible-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-extendible-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extendible-cardinal — Extendible Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e8e27514727b12c\" href=\"?note=3e8e27514727b12c\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta,j\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta,j\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (four-place predicate that builds the two membership structures and binds the elementary embedding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e8e27514727b12c\" href=\"?note=3e8e27514727b12c\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Extendible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Extendible}_S\\)</span> (extendible-cardinal predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extendible\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Extendible}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda)\\to\\exists\\theta,j\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extendible\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Extendible}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda)\\to\\exists\\theta,j\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The embedding predicate receives set-coded membership structures on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\">\\(V_\\lambda\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\theta\">\\(V_\\theta\\)</span>; bare rank sets are no longer passed to a structure-only interface.</li>\n<li>Extendible cardinals have embeddings between arbitrarily high rank segments.</li>\n<li>They imply strong partition properties.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"3e8e27514727b12c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"3e8e27514727b12c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S$ (four-place predicate that builds the two membership structures and binds the elementary embedding, see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta,j\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Extendible}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extendible\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Extendible}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa<\\lambda)\\to\\exists\\theta,j\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":1518,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c673c4a0a16f62c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-508","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-extendible-cardinal.md|58-df-extendible-cardinal]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","5582a281f15a33c2","3e8e27514727b12c"]}